One openbox theme is not a Debian package either:

  /usr/share/themes/Dracula-withoutBorder
                     Dracula for Openbox, MIT, (c) 2020 César Salazar
                     licence at /usr/share/doc/dracula-openbox/LICENSE
                     from https://github.com/dracula/openbox at commit
